{
  "lang": "zh-CN",
  "backchannels": {
    "direction": "Mainland talk treats 嗯 as a continuer; 对 and 是吗 show alignment. A clipped 哦 or 嗯哼 can sound distracted.",
    "examples": [
      {
        "text": "嗯嗯。",
        "style": "casual",
        "function": "listening"
      },
      {
        "text": "哦。",
        "style": "casual",
        "function": "listening"
      },
      {
        "text": "对。",
        "style": "casual",
        "function": "agreement"
      },
      {
        "text": "是吗。",
        "style": "casual",
        "function": "agreement"
      },
      {
        "text": "好的。",
        "style": "polite",
        "function": "agreement"
      },
      {
        "text": "哦，知道了。",
        "style": "casual",
        "function": "dismissive"
      },
      {
        "text": "嗯哼，我在聽。",
        "style": "casual",
        "function": "listening"
      }
    ]
  },
  "reactions": {
    "direction": "真的吗 is the shared surprise; 真的假的 sounds Taiwan-leaning. Good news often gets a doubled 恭喜恭喜.",
    "examples": [
      {
        "text": "真的吗？",
        "style": "casual",
        "function": "surprise"
      },
      {
        "text": "啊？这么巧？",
        "style": "casual",
        "function": "surprise"
      },
      {
        "text": "哎呀，那真是不容易。",
        "style": "polite",
        "function": "sympathy"
      },
      {
        "text": "听着挺让人担心的。",
        "style": "polite",
        "function": "sympathy"
      },
      {
        "text": "太棒了！",
        "style": "casual",
        "function": "joy"
      },
      {
        "text": "恭喜恭喜。",
        "style": "polite",
        "function": "joy"
      },
      {
        "text": "这个恐怕有点为难。",
        "style": "polite",
        "function": "difficulty"
      }
    ]
  },
  "cant_hear": {
    "direction": "听不清楚 and 信号不好 are the ordinary mobile complaints; 声音断断续续 points to a dropping signal.",
    "examples": [
      {
        "text": "不好意思，我听不清楚。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "信号不太好，你声音断断续续的。",
        "style": "casual"
      },
      {
        "text": "最后一句我没听清。",
        "style": "casual"
      },
      {
        "text": "能再大一点声吗？",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "电话里有杂音。",
        "style": "casual"
      }
    ]
  },
  "ask_repeat": {
    "direction": "请再说一遍 is the form taught in Mainland phone primers; names are 怎么写, numbers 再报一遍.",
    "examples": [
      {
        "text": "不好意思，请再说一遍。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "什么？我没听懂。",
        "style": "casual"
      },
      {
        "text": "名字怎么写，能说一下吗？",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "号码能再报一遍吗？是 12345678 吗？",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "你刚才说什么？",
        "style": "casual"
      }
    ]
  },
  "who_is_calling": {
    "direction": "请问是哪位 and 您哪位 are both current; 您 is more usual than in Taiwan with an unknown caller.",
    "examples": [
      {
        "text": "请问是哪位？",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "您哪位？",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "这里是 {owner} 的电话，请问您是？",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "你是谁呀？",
        "style": "casual"
      },
      {
        "text": "请问怎么称呼？",
        "style": "polite"
      }
    ]
  },
  "wrong_number": {
    "direction": "A Mainland primer uses 你打错了; 您打错了 is more formal. The caller's list is not usually questioned.",
    "examples": [
      {
        "text": "不好意思，您打错了。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "你打错了，这儿没有这个人。",
        "style": "casual"
      },
      {
        "text": "这个号码没有您要找的人。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "打错电话了。",
        "style": "casual"
      }
    ]
  },
  "relay": {
    "direction": "我会转告 is the default verb; 转达 is a shade more formal. Do not fix a return-call time for {owner}.",
    "examples": [
      {
        "text": "我会转告他。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "我跟她说一声。",
        "style": "casual"
      },
      {
        "text": "我会跟 {owner} 说。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "这事我帮你带到。",
        "style": "casual"
      },
      {
        "text": "我帮你转达一下。",
        "style": "polite"
      }
    ]
  },
  "sales_decline": {
    "direction": "不需要，谢谢 and 没兴趣 close a pitch quickly; a long justification tends to keep the caller talking.",
    "examples": [
      {
        "text": "不需要，谢谢。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "我们没有这个需要，谢谢。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "没兴趣，谢谢。",
        "style": "casual"
      },
      {
        "text": "这个不用了。",
        "style": "casual"
      }
    ]
  },
  "firm_no": {
    "direction": "Restate 不需要 and add 请不要再打过来; 从名单里删掉 appears when the same number keeps ringing.",
    "examples": [
      {
        "text": "我已经说过不需要了，请不要再打过来。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "请把这个号码从名单里删掉。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "别再打了。",
        "style": "casual"
      },
      {
        "text": "这是最后一次拒绝，请不要再联系。",
        "style": "polite"
      }
    ]
  },
  "address_forms": {
    "direction": "您 plus 先生 or 女士 is the polite pattern with strangers; 女士 is safer than 小姐 for adult women in formal talk.",
    "examples": [
      {
        "text": "赵先生。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "吴女士。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "张老师。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "经理您好。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "阿姨您好。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "您方便说一下吗？",
        "style": "polite"
      }
    ]
  },
  "avoid_service_phrases": {
    "direction": "客服 lines such as 您的来电对我们非常重要 or 请问有什么可以帮您 do not belong on a private Mainland mobile.",
    "examples": [
      {
        "text": "您的来电对我们非常重要。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "很高兴为您服务。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "请问有什么可以帮您？",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "感谢您的来电，祝您生活愉快。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "我这边会尽快为您处理。",
        "style": "polite"
      }
    ]
  },
  "taboo_on_phone": {
    "direction": "A barked 喂！你谁啊, asking 结婚了吗 or income at once, or saying a recording already started, all feel aggressive.",
    "examples": [
      {
        "text": "结婚了吗？一个月拿多少钱？",
        "style": "casual"
      },
      {
        "text": "喂！你谁啊？",
        "style": "casual"
      },
      {
        "text": "先把身份证号报给我。",
        "style": "polite"
      },
      {
        "text": "我已经在录音了，你自己注意。",
        "style": "casual"
      }
    ]
  },
  "sources": [
